{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "train-libre F-Droid Repo"}, "description": {"en-US": "Automated F-Droid repository for train-libre"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/icon.png", "sha256": "e0809c6a3aaa0bf8d544c1941196b5065fa044a62d3b2d12d47b4d773d72fb5e", "size": 818}}, "address": "https://rfivesix.github.io/train-libre/fdroid/repo", "timestamp": 1786571592000, "categories": {"Sports & Health": {"name": {"en-US": "Sports & Health"}}}}, "packages": {"com.rfivesix.trainlibre": {"metadata": {"added": 1786571583000, "categories": ["Sports & Health"], "issueTracker": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre/issues", "lastUpdated": 1786571585000, "license": "GPL-3.0-or-later", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre", "webSite": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre", "screenshots": {"phone": {"de-DE": [{"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/01.png", "sha256": "09cf6374645969bc32b5427026fd425f287aed88d15bd8da9e5d30b308a4060b", "size": 420715}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/02.png", "sha256": "c186caa2b10f9b86cab015039e8575712b6b693ff78d36a33a940fb1ed817718", "size": 372109}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/03.png", "sha256": "92b87adae9ff686cd3e49f98835e44be9f0c4048f1a93e0c6b051257cdc57f03", "size": 254889}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/04.png", "sha256": "bf79161e3d200e56e5d0acc2b7d0592af2e39ca21732ee0f0fb450fd6133448d", "size": 210946}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/05.png", "sha256": "78b9db2b6a54e2c6d7f6e62509748590a6ef7a8567a57dc46d0482d1e980ca69", "size": 249077}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/06.png", "sha256": "48e92ff8747a0b6149a36da86fb9d39bb0a6300108394d7afb09ce9d1db27826", "size": 719980}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/07.png", "sha256": "42451c0575aeff3a8722e352ec575b42f5a61f6a6f35d0c00fb5dc45abef3983", "size": 297062}], "en-US": [{"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/01.png", "sha256": "eef9266e64a5a4c2cf4e2aa41cbb3b47b03c65a2571cb6899d7bcefc33d7ec5a", "size": 412210}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/02.png", "sha256": "33e75cdb5cc0f5d493a0325514f5165a2cc7f36cc1b505195d89cc2082b5e4be", "size": 367374}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/03.png", "sha256": "3f46065af8e5d5d5052531cd7abb3aee70b6bb10938a4f67c49f76fc6d0ed292", "size": 237600}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/04.png", "sha256": "257499778e76a1ae5a3d5c64dabcaf1284682f769ff602d4450f53a1e10e4882", "size": 210375}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/05.png", "sha256": "5f5f498f17fb5eb53cab1607f1b244d401cc7f798cf6a64d2de6c628a4c1260d", "size": 255613}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/06.png", "sha256": "9ecb296598b7ecc2e840dfda6dd44c4fa7b0d44f4555f4547df3e70171b1b577", "size": 711768}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/07.png", "sha256": "e05ce7638ea57c4376deba2660000df4f845df3a3766fc937b517527f5dc0d18", "size": 283219}]}}, "name": {"en-US": "Train Libre", "de-DE": "Train Libre"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Open-source workout and nutrition tracker with local-first data.", "de-DE": "Open-Source Tracker für Training und Ernährung mit lokalen Daten."}, "description": {"en-US": "Train Libre is an open-source, offline-first fitness tracker for people who want serious training and nutrition logging without giving up control of their data.\n\nFeatures:\n- Log workouts set by set, including warm-ups, working sets, failure sets, dropsets, reps, weight, and RIR\n- Build reusable routines and review completed sessions\n- Track nutrition, meals, hydration, caffeine, creatine, supplements, bodyweight, and body measurements\n- Use progress statistics for PRs, consistency, muscle volume, recovery, body trends, calories, sleep, steps, and pulse where available\n- Keep app data local by default, with export and import for local backups\n- Use integrated Open Food Facts and wger-based catalog sources\n- Export supported app-recorded data one way to Google Health Connect\n- Use optional AI meal features with your own API key, disabled by default\n\nWhat makes Train Libre different:\n- Open source and developed in public\n- Offline-first, with no mandatory cloud account\n- Built for structured gym tracking instead of gamification\n- Transparent analytics designed to be understandable and useful over the long term\n\nTrain Libre is not a medical app. Recovery, sleep, and pulse features are intended for training guidance and personal tracking only and are not medical diagnosis or treatment.\n\nOpen Source:\nThe source code is publicly available and the app is developed in the open.\n", "de-DE": "Train Libre ist ein Open-Source Fitness-Tracker für Menschen, die Training und Ernährung ernsthaft protokollieren wollen, ohne die Kontrolle über ihre Daten abzugeben.\n\nFunktionen:\n- Workouts Satz für Satz protokollieren, inklusive Aufwärmsätzen, Arbeitssätzen, Sätzen bis zum Versagen, Dropsets, Wiederholungen, Gewicht und RIR\n- Routinen erstellen, wiederverwenden und abgeschlossene Einheiten auswerten\n- Ernährung, Mahlzeiten, Hydration, Koffein, Kreatin, Supplements, Körpergewicht und Körpermaße tracken\n- Statistiken für PRs, Konsistenz, Muskelvolumen, Recovery, Körpertrends, Kalorien, Schlaf, Schritte und Puls nutzen, sofern Daten verfügbar sind\n- App-Daten standardmäßig lokal behalten, inklusive Export und Import lokaler Backups\n- Integrierte Datenquellen auf Basis von Open Food Facts und wger verwenden\n- Unterstützte selbst erfasste Daten einseitig zu Google Health Connect exportieren\n- Optionale KI-Mahlzeitenfunktionen mit eigenem API-Key nutzen, standardmäßig deaktiviert\n\nWas Train Libre besonders macht:\n- Open Source und öffentlich entwickelt\n- Offline-first, ohne verpflichtenden Cloud-Account\n- Gebaut für strukturiertes Krafttraining statt Gamification\n- Transparente Analysen, die langfristig verständlich und nützlich bleiben sollen\n\nTrain Libre ist keine medizinische App. Recovery-, Schlaf- und Pulsfunktionen dienen der Trainingsplanung und persönlichen Orientierung und stellen keine medizinische Diagnose oder Behandlung dar.\n\nOpen Source:\nDer Quellcode ist öffentlich verfügbar und die App wird offen entwickelt.\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/icon_BDpnPPO5DCAteR-f5uh6yr8SZKF_miQjdDozt7si38I=.png", "sha256": "043a673cf3b90c202d791f9fe6e87acabf1264a17f9a2423743a33b7bb22dfc2", "size": 13030}, "de-DE": {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/icon_BDpnPPO5DCAteR-f5uh6yr8SZKF_miQjdDozt7si38I=.png", "sha256": "043a673cf3b90c202d791f9fe6e87acabf1264a17f9a2423743a33b7bb22dfc2", "size": 13030}}, "preferredSigner": "7bea1cc437d23ad86535001c2996c22def49d8d75bd6b4942b6aad59572b17cc"}, "versions": {"36ae10c55180931460ae5ad62cd8ee4621afe9fc55daf5e25348fa135d42615c": {"added": 1786571585000, "file": {"name": "/app-x86_64-release.apk", "sha256": "36ae10c55180931460ae5ad62cd8ee4621afe9fc55daf5e25348fa135d42615c", "size": 39315254}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["x86_64"], "versionName": "1.1.1", "versionCode": 1005006, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 36}, "signer": {"sha256": ["7bea1cc437d23ad86535001c2996c22def49d8d75bd6b4942b6aad59572b17cc"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 32}, {"name": "android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 28}, {"name": "android.permission.CAMERA"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_PROMOTED_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_STEPS"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_SLEEP"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_HEART_RATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_WEIGHT"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_BODY_FAT"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.